sequenceDiagram
    participant DDB as Amazon DynamoDB
    participant FH as Amazon Data Firehose
    participant L as AWS Lambda Processor
    participant DQ as data-quality.yml
    participant S3R as S3 Raw
    participant S3C as S3 Clean
    participant DOWN as RDS / Data Lake - Fase successiva

    DDB->>FH: CDC JSON event
    FH->>L: Invoke Lambda processor
    L->>DQ: Read DQ rules
    DQ-->>L: Rules configuration
    L->>L: Parse CDC + quality checks

    FH->>S3R: Original copy → raw
    L-->>FH: dq_status = clean
    FH->>S3C: Write clean prefix
    S3C-->>DOWN: Future ingestion

    Note over FH,DOWN: Scenario clean: il record supera i controlli e viene scritto nell'area validata.
